r-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;mso-fareast-font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;font-size:12.0pt;\">산업디지털전환 </span><span style=\"font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;mso-fareast-font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;letter-spacing:0.3pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">맞춤형 컨설팅</span><span style=\"font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;mso-fareast-font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">」 </span><span style=\"font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;mso-fareast-font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;letter-spacing:0.3pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">지원사업을 다음과 같이 모집하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;mso-fareast-font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;letter-spacing:0.3pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">맞춤형 컨설팅을 희</span><span style=\"font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;mso-fareast-font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;font-size:12.0pt;\">망하는 기업의 많은 관심과 참여바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:KoPub돋움체 Light;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align:right;word-break:keep-all;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:KoPub돋움체 Medium;mso-fareast-font-family:KoPub돋움체 Medium;font-size:13.0pt;\">경북산업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:KoPub돋움체 Medium;font-family:KoPub돋움체 Medium;mso-ascii-font-family:KoPub돋움체 Medium;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">DX</span></b><span style=\"font-family:KoPub돋움체 Medium;mso-fareast-font-family:KoPub돋움체 Medium;font-size:13.0pt;\"><b>협업지원센터</b></span></p></t